-- statement:
--   The original spectrally negative Lévy BV stopped dividend HJB physical mesh error witness with a single extra assumption giving the publicly Proved four-way drift/negative-jump/driver-residual/dividend increment decomposition for original X and controlled D on arbitrary weighted grids. All physical stochastic and expected error estimates remain outstanding.
-- source:
